fixture zone1_03_route_plain_chain
doc Room 03 (BUILD.md s5 tech 3; s15 "4 bounces per second"): the plain chain, a down-strike on every fall and nothing else between bounces: one bounce every 13 frames (4.6 a second, faster than s15's 4), 260 u apart at the dash-jump's 20 u/f. A shorter link is a shorter hop, so it takes eleven bounces to cross where the 4-a-second route takes ten (zone1_03_control_plain_ten).
